---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
const site = 'https://ewohub.com';
const slug = 'contact';
---

<Base
  title="Contact EWO"
  description="Get in touch with EWO for a free profile audit and discussion of your audience growth goals."
  lang="en"
  hreflang={[
    { lang: 'en', url: `${site}/contact` },
    { lang: 'de', url: `${site}/de/contact` },
    { lang: 'es', url: `${site}/es/contact` },
    { lang: 'ro', url: `${site}/ro/contact` },
    { lang: 'uk', url: `${site}/uk/contact` },
    { lang: 'ru', url: `${site}/ru/contact` },
  ]}
>
  <article class="page-content">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-header">
        <h1>Get in Touch</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Tell us where you are and where you want to go. We'll review your current situation
          and put together a plan before we take you on as a client.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section>
        <h2>What to Expect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Free profile audit — we review your current setup before any commitment</li>
          <li>Response within 48 hours</li>
          <li>No hard sell — if we can't genuinely help, we'll tell you</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>What to Include in Your Message</h2>
        <p>To give you a useful answer, it helps to know:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Current platform:</strong> Which platform are you streaming on right now? (Chaturbate, Stripchat, LiveJasmin, etc.)</li>
          <li><strong>Streaming hours:</strong> How many hours per week are you currently streaming?</li>
          <li><strong>Target market:</strong> Which region do you want to prioritize for traffic and viewers? (USA, Germany, UK, etc.)</li>
          <li><strong>Current situation:</strong> How long have you been active, and what does your current viewer count look like?</li>
          <li><strong>Goals:</strong> What do you want to achieve in the next 3–6 months?</li>
          <li><strong>For studios:</strong> How many models do you currently have, and which platforms are they promoting on?</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Reach Out</h2>
        <p>Message us on Telegram: <a href="https://t.me/+tBjfmjh9vHo1YzQy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">t.me/+tBjfmjh9vHo1YzQy</a></p>
      </section>

      <section class="cta-section">
        <h2>Ready for the first step?</h2>
        <p>Message us now — the sooner you start, the sooner you'll see results.</p>
        <p><a href="https://t.me/+tBjfmjh9vHo1YzQy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Telegram →</a></p>
      </section>
      <section class="related-articles">
        <h2>Related Articles</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/model-promotion">Model Promotion Services</a></li>
          <li><a href="/studio-traffic">Studio Traffic</a></li>
          <li><a href="/new-model-growth">New Model Growth</a></li>
          <li><a href="/studio-scaling">Studio Scaling</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about">About EWO</a></li>
          <li><a href="/platforms-we-work-with">Platforms We Work With</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-content { padding-block: 3rem 5rem; }
  .page-header { margin-bottom: 3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  .page-header h1 { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .lead { font-size: 1.125rem; max-width: 60ch; }
  article section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  article h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  article p { margin-bottom: 0.875rem; }
  article ul { margin: 0.75rem 0 0.875rem 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
  article li { color: var(--fg-muted); }
  article a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  article a:hover { color: var(--accent-hover); }
</style>
